{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102229","id":2308413042,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Jl5Zy","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102229","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102229.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102229.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102229","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102229/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102229/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102229/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/aaf267fda20300431ff478a3cc03da79b042e11b","number":102229,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix non-static members warning about shadowing in static context","user":{"login":"crlimacastro","id":50819894,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwODE5ODk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50819894?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crlimacastro","html_url":"https://github.com/crlimacastro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crlimacastro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crlimacastro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crlimacastro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crlimacastro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crlimacastro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crlimacastro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crlimacastro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crlimacastro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crlimacastro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixed issue in ``gdscript_analyzer.cpp`` causing it to recognize non-static members as conflicting with the names of parameters of static functions and push a ``SHADOWED_VARIABLE`` warning to the Debugger.\r\n\r\nFor example:\r\n\r\n``foo.gd``\r\n```gdscript\r\nclass_name Foo\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nvar bar: int\r\n\r\nstatic func baz(bar: int) -> void:\r\n\tprint(bar)\r\n```\r\n\r\nPushes the following warning:\r\n\r\n``\r\nW 0:00:01:0408   The local function parameter \"bar\" is shadowing an already-declared variable at line 4 in the current class.\r\n  <GDScript Error>SHADOWED_VARIABLE\r\n  <GDScript Source>foo.gd:6\r\n``\r\n\r\nAnd:\r\n\r\n``foo2.gd``\r\n```gdscript \r\nclass_name Foo2\r\nextends Foo\r\n\r\nstatic func baz2(bar: int) -> void:\r\n\tprint(bar)\r\n```\r\n\r\nPushes the following warning:\r\n\r\n``\r\nW 0:00:01:0408   The local function parameter \"bar\" is shadowing an already-declared variable at line 4 in the base class \"Foo\".\r\n  <GDScript Error>SHADOWED_VARIABLE_BASE_CLASS\r\n  <GDScript Source>foo2.gd:4\r\n``\r\n\r\nThis warning is unnecessary (and potentially confusing) as, even though the ``bar`` member variable of ``Foo`` is named the same as the parameter of ``func baz`` and ``func baz2``, these static functions do not have access to the class' non-static member.\r\n\r\nThe changes proposed check that non-static members are not considered for shadowing warnings in static contexts.\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/63120*","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw